 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "五种放法",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 122.51,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "私钥是一个 256 位的随机数，用来给交易签名。",
   "spoken": "私钥是一个 256 位的随机数，用来给交易签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.052,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 4.15,
   "speechEnd": 7.531
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "谁能让私钥签一笔交易，谁就拥有这笔资产。",
   "spoken": "谁能让私钥签一笔交易，谁就拥有这笔资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 8.592,
   "dur": 4.128,
   "speechStart": 8.69,
   "speechEnd": 11.868
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "助记词是 12 或 24 个单词，可以推导出一组私钥。",
   "spoken": "助记词是 12 或 24 个单词，可以推导出一组私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 12.94,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 13.038,
   "speechEnd": 16.907
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "放私钥的方法，常见的有五种。",
   "spoken": "放私钥的方法，常见的有五种。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 17.96,
   "dur": 3.408,
   "speechStart": 18.058,
   "speechEnd": 20.558
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "第一种，助记词软件钱包，私钥在手机、电脑或浏览器扩展里。",
   "spoken": "第一种，助记词软件钱包，私钥在手机、电脑或浏览器扩展里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 21.588,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 21.686,
   "speechEnd": 26.769
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "设备被攻破，钱就没了。",
   "spoken": "设备被攻破，钱就没了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 27.808,
   "dur": 3.0,
   "speechStart": 27.906,
   "speechEnd": 29.989
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "第二种，硬件钱包，私钥在一块独立芯片里，不离开设备。",
   "spoken": "第二种，硬件钱包，私钥在一块独立芯片里，不离开设备。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 31.028,
   "dur": 5.376,
   "speechStart": 31.126,
   "speechEnd": 35.566
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "它只负责签名，签之前，人要看清签的是什么。",
   "spoken": "它只负责签名，签之前，人要看清签的是什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 36.624,
   "dur": 4.728,
   "speechStart": 36.722,
   "speechEnd": 40.543
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "第三种，多签，比如 Safe，几个独立私钥加一个链上合约。",
   "spoken": "第三种，多签，比如 Safe，几个独立私钥加一个链上合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 41.572,
   "dur": 5.976,
   "speechStart": 41.67,
   "speechEnd": 46.705
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "签名数达到门槛，交易才执行。",
   "spoken": "签名数达到门槛，交易才执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 47.768,
   "dur": 3.624,
   "speechStart": 47.866,
   "speechEnd": 50.568
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "第四种，MPC 门限签名，私钥被切成几个分片。",
   "spoken": "第四种，MPC 门限签名，私钥被切成几个分片。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 51.612,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 51.71,
   "speechEnd": 55.817
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "几方各自计算，合成一个普通签名，完整私钥从不出现。",
   "spoken": "几方各自计算，合成一个普通签名，完整私钥从不出现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 56.872,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 56.97,
   "speechEnd": 61.553
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "第五种，HSM，私钥锁在专用硬件里，不能导出。",
   "spoken": "第五种，HSM，私钥锁在专用硬件里，不能导出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 62.612,
   "dur": 5.208,
   "speechStart": 62.71,
   "speechEnd": 66.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "它只按指令签名，不判断指令对不对。",
   "spoken": "它只按指令签名，不判断指令对不对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 68.04,
   "dur": 3.72,
   "speechStart": 68.138,
   "speechEnd": 70.911
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "签名人看不懂签的内容就签，叫盲签。",
   "spoken": "签名人看不懂签的内容就签，叫盲签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 71.98,
   "dur": 4.176,
   "speechStart": 72.078,
   "speechEnd": 75.328
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "软件钱包和 HSM，盲签风险最高。",
   "spoken": "软件钱包和 HSM，盲签风险最高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 76.376,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 76.474,
   "speechEnd": 79.581
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "多签的门槛写在链上，谁都能查，MPC 在链上只是一个普通地址。",
   "spoken": "多签的门槛写在链上，谁都能查，MPC 在链上只是一个普通地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 80.652,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 80.75,
   "speechEnd": 85.738
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "打个比方，私钥是保险柜的钥匙。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，私钥是保险柜的钥匙。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 86.8,
   "dur": 3.432,
   "speechStart": 86.898,
   "speechEnd": 89.386
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "多签像一个柜子三把锁，要两把一起开。",
   "spoken": "多签像一个柜子三把锁，要两把一起开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 90.452,
   "dur": 3.888,
   "speechStart": 90.55,
   "speechEnd": 93.502
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "可如果锁的主人看同一块屏幕，三把锁就退化成一把。",
   "spoken": "可如果锁的主人看同一块屏幕，三把锁就退化成一把。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 94.56,
   "dur": 5.088,
   "speechStart": 94.658,
   "speechEnd": 98.836
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的钥匙被复制，会留下痕迹。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的钥匙被复制，会留下痕迹。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-21.mp3",
   "start": 99.868,
   "dur": 5.136,
   "speechStart": 99.966,
   "speechEnd": 104.168
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "私钥被复制，不留任何痕迹，直到资产被转走，你才知道。",
   "spoken": "私钥被复制，不留任何痕迹，直到资产被转走，你才知道。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-22.mp3",
   "start": 105.224,
   "dur": 6.336,
   "speechStart": 105.322,
   "speechEnd": 110.738
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "所以方案的强度，取决于最容易被攻破的那个环节。",
   "spoken": "所以方案的强度，取决于最容易被攻破的那个环节。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-23.mp3",
   "start": 111.78,
   "dur": 4.872,
   "speechStart": 111.878,
   "speechEnd": 115.818
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-24",
   "text": "一台设备，一行日志，一个签名人的眼睛。",
   "spoken": "一台设备，一航日志，一个签名人的眼睛。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg2-24.mp3",
